 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idm116103472\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\" id=\"8\">Link to Learning</div>\n    <span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp49045184\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n        <img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20220509.174553/resources/0e181b8df0950758a59591bb95b11176cf3cd111\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" id=\"9\">\n    </span>\n    <p id=\"fs-idm187859568\">Watch an animated tutorial about the workings of <em data-effect=\"italics\">lac</em> operon here.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1165239273914\" data-alt=\"lac_operon\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"alternatives\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/16-2-prokaryotic-gene-regulation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click to view content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/lac_operon\" class=\"os-is-iframe\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
